#. Windows installer: FinishText.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid ""
"Rufin has been installed on your computer.\n"
"\n"
"Click Finish to finalize Setup."
msgstr ""
"Rufin on sinu arvutisse paigaldatud.\n"
"\n"
"Algseadistamise lõpetamiseks vajuta Lõpeta."

#. Windows installer: WelcomeText.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid ""
"Rufin is native music player for Jellyfin, Navidrome/OpenSubsonic, Plex, and "
"Emby servers;  local folders,  WebDAV including a direct Nextcloud browser "
"login path, Samba and NAS shares.\n"
"\n"
"This setup will install Rufin in your computer.\n"
"\n"
"Click Next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Rufin on keskkonnale omane muusikapleier Jellyfini, Navidrome'i/"
"OpenSubsonicu, Plexi ja Emby serverite jaoks; lisaks esitamiseks kohalikest "
"kaustadest, WebDAV-ist, sealhulgas otse Nextcloudi kaustapuust/sisselogimise "
"aadressilt, Samba ja NAS-i serveritest jagatud kaustadest.\n"
"\n"
"Järgnevaga paigaldad Rufini oma arvutisse.\n"
"\n"
"Jätkamiseks klõpsa Edasi."

#. Windows installer: CleanupFailed.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid ""
"Setup could not remove the existing Rufin files. Close Rufin and try again."
msgstr ""
"Olemasolevate Rufini failide eemaldamine ei õnnestunud. Sulge Rufin ja "
"proovi uuesti."

#. Windows installer: DirectoryConflict.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid "Choose a separate installation folder."
msgstr "Vali muu paigalduskaust."

#. Windows installer: CloseToInstall. {app_name} is the application display name.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid "Close {app_name} and try the installation again."
msgstr "Sulge {app_name} ja proovi paigaldamist uuesti."

#. Windows installer: CloseToUninstall. {app_name} is the application display name.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid "Close {app_name} and try the uninstall again."
msgstr "Sulge {app_name} ja proovi eemaldamist uuesti."

#. Windows installer: FinishTitle.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid "Completing Rufin Setup"
msgstr "Rufini algseadistus on lõpetamisel"

#. Windows installer: DesktopShortcut.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid "Create desktop shortcut"
msgstr "Lisa link töölauale"

#. Windows installer: RemoveCache. {app_name} is the application display name.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid "Remove {app_name}'s cache"
msgstr "Kustuta {app_name}i puhverdatud andmed"

#. Windows installer: InstallWriteFailed.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid "Setup could not complete the installation. Please try again."
msgstr "Paigaldamise lõpetamine ei õnnestunud. Palun proovi uuesti."

#. Windows installer: InvalidUpdate. {app_name} is the application display name.
msgctxt "Windows installer"
msgid "The {app_name} automatic update option is invalid."
msgstr "Rakenduse automaatse uuenduse seadistus on vigane: {app_name}."

